<title>UK: Stuttgarter Bank sets 150 mln mark FRN due 2002. [CORRECTED 11:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>Stuttgarter Bank sets 150 mln mark FRN due 2002. [CORRECTED 11:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers GZB Bank and DG Bank (corrects from WGZ Bank and DG Bank).</p>
<p> BORROWER   STUTTGARTER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/8	PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.96     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    STUT	DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
